-06-11T23:06:55.940Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/dmitrymanning-coe/Documents/Research/FRA/fra_proj/experiments/fra_win","sessionId":"8a660228-bde0-4e60-bfe2-aafb33fe0b4d","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"autoresearch/fra-behavioral-win","slug":"moonlit-churning-gem"}
