{"parentUuid":"a055254f-caa7-4a21-953d-14b2c496719b","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6f22e38681eea6df","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01Y9TcF1snrzrdVjPYADd3Y3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**THEORY_HIERARCHY.md is written** at `/Users/dmitrymanning-coe/Documents/Research/FRA/fra_proj/experiments/fra_hierarchy/THEORY_HIERARCHY.md` (CAMPAIGN.md STATE updated). The PI addendum (routed-fraction measurement, circuit-tracing framing, α-knob spine) is fully folded in. Summary:\n\n**§1 Theory of broad×broad cutting.** Breadth = firing measure B(μ); height split into activation hierarchy (parent = OR of children) and geometric hierarchy (child = α_h·parent + ⊥), with two dictionary regimes: H1 (parent latent exists → the link is ONE cell) and H2 (virtual parent / feature-splitting → the link is a **rank-1 block** of child×child cells, ω_{c_i,d_j} ≈ α_h²σ). Mechanistically: specific×specific edits the model's bigram *data*; broad×broad edits its concept-level routing *program*. The key structural result replacing conjunction-rarity (which is gone in the broad regime): **a per-position gate cannot split one attention row between two key families; a per-edge cell edit can** — so the decisive test case is *mixed-domain prompts*, where any gated steer couples X-removal to Y-collateral ≈1:1. The when-it-works statement is the win-checklist lifted via a **transport × gating decomposition**: context-conditional behavior = attention transport (always) × persona gating, which is either in the scores (G-score, FRA-cuttable) or post-transport (G-post: OV/MLP/direction — the em_svd EM mechanism, FRA-blind). Superposition made precise: linear removal pays α_h on every hierarchy child + ρ̄-interference × all residual readers; the oracle-gated cell edit pays only softmax redistribution (ρ-independent); the SAE-gated edit pays gate false-fire rate. Predicted A(ρ) = ρ-independent factorization floor A₀ (mixed prompts) + interference slope; magnitude law lifts to **A(K) ∝ K** preserved domains.\n\n**§2 Routed-fraction dial + methodological thesis (PI addendum).** Measurement ladder: probes < **pattern-freeze** (one intervention, gives (1−α) directly — run first) < **EAP with the S-vs-V split** (headline dial; only the Q/K-path share is FRA-addressable) < attribution graphs (which *freeze* patterns — they inherit exactly the blind spot). Thesis: **EAP localizes the edge; FRA resolves it** — the intervention ladder direction-removal ⊃ head-ablation ⊃ position-oracle edge-ablation ⊃ cell-edit, with the cell needing no runtime classifier (the conjunction is the classifier, weight-baked).\n\n**§3 Regression protocol.** LP/LASSO over α∈[0,1]^|C|: min‖α‖₁ s.t. removal ≥ τΔ, collateral ≤ κ; design matrix = one-backward *cell-granularity attribution patching* (formally the same estimator as EAP, finer); two-stage screen→exact-refit for the softmax nonlinearity; strict train/eval split. Provably subsumes top-K (no preserve constraints + orthogonal effects) and differential cells (sibling preserve constraint, with partial weights buying back the 58%→33% reach cost). Buys: H2 block discovery with **rank-1 factorization that names the hidden parents**, and the **removability frontier R\\*(κ)** whose infeasibility is the negative certificate — the (α̂, R\\*) pair is the complete go/no-go.\n\n**§4 The buildable synthetic (the priority).** Hand-built, no training, CPU-afternoon: 256 ground-truth features (1 persona parent + 8 children, K=4 domain parents + 64 children, filler) in d=64 superposition with α_h=0.6 hierarchy; exact rank-1 QK routes via orthonormal head-basis construction (persona→all-domains mis-routes + sink on H_mis; domain-coherence aligned routes on H_coh; V1 adds same-head legit traffic); **the spine is the planted tunable α**: m_k = attention-transported payload (α·Δ) + a bilinear direct-path neuron (1−α)·Δ, total gap constant. Eight non-strawman interventions (oracle/SAE/regression cell edits, ungated/gated DoM, key-side removal, head ablation, position-oracle edge ablation), 6 figures with explicit pass/fail numbers, pre-registered P1–P8, experiments E1–E8 + red-team section (dedicated-head rigging → V1 mandatory; basis-rigging → E7/E8; explicit falsification condition for the PI's hypothesis).\n\n**§5 Real-LLM handoff.** Battery in order: pattern-freeze → EAP S/V split → FRA-diff localization → R\\*(κ) → pre-registered magnitude forecast. Candidates ranked by P(score-routed): sycophancy×opinion (best — definitionally retrieval), format-instruction×domain, in-context backdoor×class, refusal×topic (trigger-vs-payload split), **EM×domain flagship last/riskiest** — em_svd says the payload is a direction; the live target is the *domain-conditional* component, metric: domain-X-specific EM drops while generic EM persists; a negative is still a result (feature-resolved dissociation)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":650,"cache_read_input_tokens":111421,"output_tokens":1872,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":650},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1872,"cache_read_input_tokens":111421,"cache_creation_input_tokens":650,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":650,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbxK3nZGyhAc3e6DBCztW","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"67154a82-d76e-4118-832e-4e51357fc1f4","timestamp":"2026-06-11T23:07:23.640Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/dmitrymanning-coe/Documents/Research/FRA/fra_proj/experiments/fra_win","sessionId":"8a660228-bde0-4e60-bfe2-aafb33fe0b4d","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"autoresearch/fra-behavioral-win","slug":"moonlit-churning